@startuml

title The overload states of a lane

hide empty description

[*] --> Live

state Live : persist every tick
state CatchingUp : persist the newest tick of each datum for each second
state Shedding : drop every tick older than the age limit

Live --> CatchingUp : lag above the first limit
CatchingUp --> Live : lag below half of the first limit
CatchingUp --> Shedding : lag above the second limit
Shedding --> CatchingUp : lag below half of the second limit

note right of Shedding
    Every state keeps the live path fresh.
    Only the store thins its history.
    Each drop is counted by reason.
end note

@enduml
